:: done {"position":"725,3050","size":"100,100"}
<span style="color: #73AB76;">Kiran:</span> That would actually be really helpful. I think part of what made this rejection so difficult was feeling like I didn't know what to do afterward.

Thank you for your help.

I think, now that I've reframed my failure and recognize that this does not define me, I can readily take next steps

Goodbye!

<div style="
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 40px;
  left: 40px;
  z-index: 1000;
">
[[Next|wefwfww22]]
</div>


:: eegaeg {"position":"725,2500","size":"100,100"}
<span style="color: #73AB76;">Kiran:</span> Thank you. I think talking about it has helped me realize that I don't have to let one setback stop me from trying again.

//Kiran pauses//

I still feel a little overwhelmed, though. I want to move forward, but I'm not really sure where to start.

[["Actually, McMaster has several resources that might help! Would you like to explore some of them together?"|wfwfwfwf2222]]

[["I have to go now... bye|wefwfww22]]

